{"data":{"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Intellectyx, Inc","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/1fe9cae2ab66497ffb701915b4472908/bc3b9/intellectyx.png","srcSet":"/static/1fe9cae2ab66497ffb701915b4472908/9a130/intellectyx.png 175w,\n/static/1fe9cae2ab66497ffb701915b4472908/a3fa1/intellectyx.png 350w,\n/static/1fe9cae2ab66497ffb701915b4472908/bc3b9/intellectyx.png 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/1fe9cae2ab66497ffb701915b4472908/dae43/intellectyx.avif 175w,\n/static/1fe9cae2ab66497ffb701915b4472908/d7667/intellectyx.avif 350w,\n/static/1fe9cae2ab66497ffb701915b4472908/7ec1a/intellectyx.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/1fe9cae2ab66497ffb701915b4472908/5d873/intellectyx.webp 175w,\n/static/1fe9cae2ab66497ffb701915b4472908/26a00/intellectyx.webp 350w,\n/static/1fe9cae2ab66497ffb701915b4472908/f23f0/intellectyx.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"tech":["FastAPI","OpenAI","Hugging Face","Pinecone","FAISS"],"github":null,"external":"https://www.intellectyx.com/","cta":null,"caseStudy":"/work/intellectyx"},"html":"<p>At Intellectyx, I built an LLM-powered knowledge assistant from 0 to 1 for enterprise document intelligence.\nThe product combined semantic search, document Q&#x26;A, and workflow automation using a full RAG pipeline from chunking and embeddings to retrieval and generation.\nI designed ingestion and data workflows for messy, unstructured content, then shipped low-latency FastAPI services with streaming responses for production usage.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Suki AI","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/eb5c9793df